<h2>How to assess Mwanasoka tips</h2>
<p>Take the selection, then check the match:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Recent form:</strong> the last six matches, weighted by opponent.</li>
  <li><strong>Home/away record:</strong> travel and venue matter in local competitions too.</li>
  <li><strong>League position:</strong> useful when the points gap is genuine.</li>
  <li><strong>Head-to-head:</strong> supporting evidence, weaker across squad turnover.</li>
  <li><strong>Team news:</strong> confirmed injuries and suspensions, never rumoured ones.</li>
  <li><strong>Market fit:</strong> result or goals, based on what the evidence supports.</li>
</ul>
<p>Where lineup information is not confirmed, this page says nothing rather than guessing — thin data is a reason to lower confidence, not to invent detail.</p>

